[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by his", "start": 2.56, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "excellency Peter Pellegrini, the", "start": 6.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "president of the Slovak Republic. I", "start": 9.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "request the protocol to escort his", "start": 12.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 14.0, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 16.32, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. Chairman, excellencies, ladies and", "start": 29.599, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "gentlemen,", "start": 32.559, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "every country that enters this hall", "start": 34.48, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "brings its own concerns.", "start": 36.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "For some, security means protecting", "start": 39.68, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "borders. For others, it means food,", "start": 42.32, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "water, energy, or the future of their", "start": 46.0, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "children.", "start": 49.44, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "And many countries face all of these", "start": 50.96, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "challenges at once.", "start": 53.28, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "That is why a world ruled mainly by", "start": 55.76, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "power rather than by rules would be", "start": 57.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "dangerous for everyone.", "start": 61.12, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "For smaller countries such as Slovakia,", "start": 63.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "this is especially clear.", "start": 66.479, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "But no country, large or small, is truly", "start": 69.68, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "safe in a world where international law", "start": 73.28, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "is ignored and institutions are", "start": 76.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "weakened. Sadly, we no longer need to", "start": 78.08, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "imagine such a world. We can already see", "start": 82.0, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "parts of it around us.", "start": 85.36, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Trade is becoming less predictable.", "start": 88.799, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Security cooperation is more fragmented.", "start": 91.52, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "The idea that every country should have", "start": 95.439, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "a voice is under pressure.", "start": 97.92, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "And when rules are weakened,", "start": 101.36, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "when cooperation is replaced by", "start": 104.079, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "confrontation,", "start": 106.159, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "all of us become more vulnerable.", "start": 107.68, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "But we still have a choice.", "start": 111.28, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "The international system we have built", "start": 114.159, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "is not perfect.", "start": 116.159, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "It can be slow. It can be frustrating.", "start": 118.32, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "At times, it does not deliver as quickly", "start": 122.56, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "as people need.", "start": 124.799, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "But the solution is not to destroy it.", "start": 127.439, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "The solution is to make it work better.", "start": 130.879, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "Slovakia is firmly anchored in the", "start": 134.72, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "United Nations, NATO, and the European", "start": 137.44, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "Union. We believe in cooperation,", "start": 140.239, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "but we also believe that institutions", "start": 144.239, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "must produce real results.", "start": 146.64, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Over the past year, Slovakia has hosted", "start": 150.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "several international meetings and", "start": 153.36, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "offered space for dialogue", "start": 155.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "where we can be useful. We are ready to", "start": 158.319, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "help bring parties together and to", "start": 161.04, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "support diplomacy within the UN", "start": 163.12, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "framework.", "start": 165.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Because when diplomacy stops,", "start": 167.04, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "confrontation fills the space.", "start": 170.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "That is why when we speak about the", "start": 174.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "United Nations, I believe in evolution", "start": 176.64, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "rather than revolution.", "start": 180.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "The world has changed and the United", "start": 183.84, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Nations must change with it.", "start": 186.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "The Security Council should better", "start": 190.48, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "reflect today's realities and give a", "start": 192.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "stronger voice to countries and regions", "start": 195.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "that are still under represented.", "start": 197.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Countries from the region often", "start": 201.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "understand a crisis best. Giving them a", "start": 203.12, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "stronger voice can help us act earlier", "start": 206.8, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and prevent escalation.", "start": 210.4, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Slovakia sees its engagement in UN", "start": 213.36, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "reform as a part of its responsibility", "start": 216.159, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "to this organization including through", "start": 219.84, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "UN80 and the implementation of the pact", "start": 223.2, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "for the future. Our responsibility to", "start": 227.04, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "the wider international order is also", "start": 230.72, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "reflected in our candidacy for the", "start": 233.599, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "security council for 2028 and 2029.", "start": 236.319, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "We would be of course grateful for your", "start": 240.48, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "trust and support. If elected, Slovakia", "start": 242.4, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "will focus on four priorities.", "start": 247.12, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "international law and the UN charter,", "start": 250.319, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "accountable security institutions,", "start": 253.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the protection of strategic resources", "start": 256.239, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "and critical infrastructure,", "start": 258.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "and the security challenges linked to", "start": 261.44, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "digitalization and artificial", "start": 264.08, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "intelligence.", "start": 266.32, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "I fully share the concern of the United", "start": 268.8, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Nations about the inequalities that can", "start": 271.04, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "be created by unequal access to", "start": 273.759, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "artificial intelligence.", "start": 276.96, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "It is in our common interest that", "start": 279.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "innovation benefits all of humanity, not", "start": 281.759, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "only the strongest economies or the", "start": 285.36, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "biggest companies.", "start": 287.44, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "If AI is available only to a few, new", "start": 289.52, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "divisions will appear. Entire", "start": 293.759, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "communities may be left behind.", "start": 296.479, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "The growing use of AI powered weapons", "start": 300.4, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and autonomous systems also requires", "start": 303.199, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "urgent attention.", "start": 306.16, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "One principle must remain clear.", "start": 308.56, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Machines should never be allowed to make", "start": 311.28, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "life or death decisions on their own.", "start": 314.639, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Just as the international community", "start": 319.039, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "developed rules for nuclear, chemical,", "start": 321.919, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "and biological weapons, we also need", "start": 325.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "strong international frameworks for", "start": 328.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "these new technologies.", "start": 331.12, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "The United Nations can and should play a", "start": 333.68, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "leading role in this effort.", "start": 337.039, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "AI is not only a potential threat on the", "start": 340.479, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "battlefield.", "start": 343.68, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "It is already having a negative impact", "start": 345.199, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "on society, especially in education.", "start": 348.08, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "An entire generation of young people is", "start": 352.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "being affected.", "start": 355.28, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Recent assessments show declining test", "start": 357.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "scores across the vast majority of", "start": 360.4, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "countries.", "start": 362.72, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "This is a concerning trend that deserves", "start": 364.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "open and serious discussion on", "start": 367.52, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "international platforms such as the", "start": 369.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "United Nations.", "start": 372.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "At the same time, we should not see AI", "start": 374.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "only as a risk. It can be also a tool", "start": 377.44, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "for peace.", "start": 380.56, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "It can help us analyze information,", "start": 382.479, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "identify patterns, and overcome language", "start": 385.199, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "barriers in real time. It can support", "start": 387.759, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "better decisions, faster responses, and", "start": 391.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "more effective prevention.", "start": 394.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "With responsible use, proper human", "start": 396.56, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "oversight, and good governance, we can", "start": 399.68, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "move this technology away from the", "start": 402.4, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "battlefield and towards diplomacy,", "start": 404.319, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "mediation, and conflict prevention.", "start": 407.039, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "and prevention matters. Every conflict", "start": 410.479, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "we prevent saves lives.", "start": 413.6, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "It protects development.", "start": 417.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "It preserves human dignity.", "start": 419.919, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Once violence begins, every solution", "start": 422.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "becomes harder, more costly, and more", "start": 426.479, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "painful.", "start": 429.12, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "There is no need to reinvent the wheel", "start": 431.039, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "when we reform international", "start": 433.52, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "institutions.", "start": 435.28, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "AI may be revolutionary,", "start": 437.12, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "but we did not need to reinvent the", "start": 439.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "personal computer in order to build it.", "start": 441.599, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "The same is true in global politics.", "start": 444.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "We should improve what already exists,", "start": 448.08, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "not start again from zero.", "start": 450.96, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "But let's ask ourselves a simple", "start": 454.16, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "question.", "start": 456.319, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "What if we as world leaders would start", "start": 458.319, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "again", "start": 462.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "following the UN charter?", "start": 464.319, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Would reform even matter if we finally", "start": 466.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "did our best for global peace?", "start": 469.12, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "Too many conflicts are still driven by", "start": 472.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the belief that political problems can", "start": 474.639, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "be solved by force, by changing borders,", "start": 477.84, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "violating sovereignity, and ignoring", "start": 481.44, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "international rules. We need to reject", "start": 484.24, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "this logic. Leadership is not shown by", "start": 487.28, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "the willingness to escalate. It requires", "start": 490.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "the courage to deescalate.", "start": 494.16, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "International rules may sound abstract", "start": 497.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "in this hall, but on the ground they are", "start": 499.759, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "very real.", "start": 503.36, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "They can mean the difference between", "start": 505.199, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "life and death.", "start": 507.36, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "When these rules are ignored, civilians", "start": 510.639, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "suffer. Communities are destroyed,", "start": 513.519, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "millions are displaced,", "start": 516.88, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "supply chains are disrupted, prosperity", "start": 519.36, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "is lost, and there is even a deeper", "start": 522.399, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "danger. If violence becomes normal for", "start": 525.76, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "the next generation, diplomacy itself", "start": 529.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "will become harder.", "start": 532.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "What is difficult to solve today may", "start": 534.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "become impossible tomorrow.", "start": 537.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "That is why our most urgent task must be", "start": 540.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "clear. Stop the violence, keep diplomacy", "start": 543.68, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "alive, and prevent today's conflicts", "start": 547.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "from becoming tomorrow's normal.", "start": 549.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "The war in Ukraine, now in its fifth", "start": 553.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "year, continues to bring destruction", "start": 556.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "close to Slovakia's borders.", "start": 558.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Attacks on civilian areas and critical", "start": 561.839, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "infrastructure remain unacceptable.", "start": 564.32, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "A ceasefire is still distant and lasting", "start": 568.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "peace even further away.", "start": 571.839, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "We should support every serious", "start": 574.88, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "diplomatic effort that can help end", "start": 577.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Russia's war against Ukraine and build a", "start": 580.08, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "safe future for our neighbor.", "start": 582.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Our commitment to international law and", "start": 586.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "human dignity cannot stop at Europe's", "start": 588.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "borders.", "start": 591.839, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "The same basic principles must guide us", "start": 593.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "in the Middle East.", "start": 595.76, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "International humanitarian law must be", "start": 598.0, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "respected.", "start": 600.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Civilians must be protected.", "start": 602.399, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Humanitarian aid must reach those who", "start": 605.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "need it, including in Gaza.", "start": 607.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "There can be no justification for", "start": 611.2, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "terrorism, anti-semitism, anti-Muslim", "start": 613.2, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "hatred, or calls to violence.", "start": 616.88, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Israelis and Palestinians both deserve", "start": 621.12, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "to live in security and dignity. At", "start": 623.92, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "Slovakia continues to support a", "start": 627.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "negotiated two-state solution with", "start": 630.399, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Israel and independent Palestinian state", "start": 633.12, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "living side by side in peace and", "start": 636.399, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "security.", "start": 639.44, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "Other conflicts that are currently out", "start": 641.44, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "of the spotlight must not escape our", "start": 644.079, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "attention and our efforts to solve them.", "start": 646.399, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "Take for example the civil war in Sudan", "start": 650.079, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "that has triggered the world's largest", "start": 653.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "humanitarian crisis.", "start": 655.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 658.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the first words of our charter are, \"We", "start": 660.959, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "the peoples of the United Nations.\"", "start": 665.519, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "Today we need that sense of shared", "start": 669.36, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "responsibility again. Armed conflicts", "start": 671.2, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "have reached levels we have not seen", "start": 674.64, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "since the Second World War.", "start": 676.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "civilians continue to pay an", "start": 678.959, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "unacceptable price.", "start": 682.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "We already have institutions.", "start": 685.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "We already have rules. We already have", "start": 687.68, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "knowledge.", "start": 690.88, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "But what we need now is the will to use", "start": 692.399, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "them.", "start": 695.68, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "This year, the United Nations will", "start": 697.519, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "choose its next Secretary General.", "start": 699.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Slovakia supports a transparent and", "start": 702.399, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "inclusive process based on merit with", "start": 704.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "due regard to regional diversity and", "start": 707.839, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "gender balance.", "start": 710.16, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "And I would also like to thank Secretary", "start": 712.0, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "General Antonio Gutes for his dedicated", "start": 714.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "service and leadership during these", "start": 716.959, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "difficult years.", "start": 718.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "The next Secretary General will inherit", "start": 721.04, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "an organization under serious security,", "start": 724.0, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "geopolitical, institutional and", "start": 727.68, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "financial pressure.", "start": 729.839, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "But the future of the United Nations", "start": 732.079, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "will not depend on one person alone. It", "start": 734.16, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "depends on all of us, on our will,", "start": 737.44, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "courage and determination.", "start": 741.2, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "We, the peoples of the United Nations,", "start": 744.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "should not leave the next generation a", "start": 748.8, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "world where violence is normal and", "start": 750.8, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "diplomacy is the exception. Thank you", "start": 754.399, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "very much for your attention.", "start": 757.839, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 763.279, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "thank uh the president of the Slovak", "start": 766.16, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Republic.", "start": 768.24, "duration": 2.24}]